  "details": "Now when avatar testing (test builds in sdk, categoty 'other' in game) you need to change to another avatar and then back to the tested one in order to update it. In old menu you need to click on same avi and change into it. Please allow to recursively change into the same test avatar. Also in wings of QM aka launchpad test avatars are broken for ages (you rejoin world - qm still thinks that you are in a test one) and having click on the icon of the test avatar reloading it no matter what you're wearing now could be nice. Thank you.",
